- Invent a private codebook category the reader must already know (`the report`, `little steps`, craft hyphenates like `reality-rename` used as if they were dialogue)
- Assume the reader remembers what a house phrase meant three chapters ago
- Paste the same witty excuse or thesis smile into every escalation beat
- Reify the telling kink as `the report` / `reports` across chapters

**Bad:**
